<title>USA: Biomagnetic Tech FY96 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>Biomagnetic Tech FY96 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sept. 30, 1996    YEAR   Sept. 30, 1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.37    loss	  $0.27</p>
<p> Net loss		  14,816    loss	  6,673</p>
<p> Revs			 1,068		    9,196</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 figures were unavailable.</p>
<p>Backlog at Sept. 30 was $16.25 million versus $9.3 million one year ago.</p>
